WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.120
Duplicate detection and duplicate resolution are
different stages Detection

00:00:06.147 --> 00:00:11.739
tries to find plausible candidate groups Resolution
decides what

00:00:11.765 --> 00:00:17.722
to do with them That could mean choosing a survivor
merging complementary fields

00:00:17.893 --> 00:00:23.464
quarantining the group or sending it for human
review Separating the

00:00:23.491 --> 00:00:25.754
stages makes deduplication safer
